<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish NTMA to auction 150mln of variable rate bond.</title>
<headline>Irish NTMA to auction 150mln of variable rate bond.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's National Treasury Management Agency (NTMA) said on Friday that it would auction 150 million Irish pounds of the variable rate Treasury bond due 2000 on February 24.</p>
<p>Bids must be received by 1130 GMT on that date.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
